OL,3,GNEWSACouncil facing #8.7m overspend,
OL,4,Areport says
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council is forecast to be making a
OL,7,Fmulti-million pound overspend by the
OL,8,Fend of the financial year, according to
OL,9,Fa report.
OL,11,FMiddlesbrough Council is currently
OL,12,Fpredicted to spend #8.7m more than its
OL,13,F#200m budget by March 2027, the
OL,14,Fauthority's routine quarterly forecast
OL,15,Fshowed.
